<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Whitney initiated.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Whitney initiated.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Robinson Humphrey said it initiated coverage of Whitney Holding Corp with a long-term buy rating and a near-term market perform rating.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 3/4 to 40 in early Nasdaq trade.</p>
<p>-- Analyst was not immediately available to comment.</p>
</text>
